---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Start a Project | ATECT Architecture" description="Tell ATECT Architecture about your residential or commercial project in Maryland, Washington, DC, or Virginia.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">Start a Project</div><h1>Tell us what you're planning.</h1><p>Share the basics of your project and we can identify the right next conversation.</p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="contact-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Project Inquiry</div><h2>Start with the essentials.</h2><p class="section-intro">Include as much information as you are comfortable sharing. For an initial conversation, project location, type, scope and goals are especially useful.</p><p><strong>Service Area</strong><br />Maryland • Washington, DC • Virginia</p></div><form class="contact-form" action="mailto:info@atectarchitecture.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="Name" required /><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" type="email" name="Email" required /><label for="phone">Phone</label><input id="phone" name="Phone" /><label for="type">Project Type</label><select id="type" name="Project Type"><option>New Home</option><option>Addition</option><option>Renovation</option><option>Commercial</option><option>Other</option></select><label for="location">Project Location</label><input id="location" name="Project Location" placeholder="City, State" /><label for="scope">Tell us about the project</label><textarea id="scope" name="Project Details" placeholder="Describe the property, goals, approximate size and what you need designed."></textarea><button type="submit">Send Project Inquiry</button></form></div></section>
</Layout>
